{"3304420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrolabus", "steam_appid": 3304420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astrolabus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alaska. October, 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a cabin. There are footprints in the snow outside that lead away from the door, and a second set that lead nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not remember anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere beneath the wilderness — beneath an illegal grow operation, beneath the older things that were buried before either of those — a laboratory is failing. Lights flicker on without anyone to throw the switch. Doors open onto rooms that were not there a moment ago. And from the deepest chamber, a voice that does not sound like a voice has begun to speak in the calm, patient cadence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its name, it tells you, is <i>Astrolabus</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not explain what it is. It does not explain what happened. It explains thresholds, probabilities, and the configurations under which a system remains viable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are going to have to fill in the rest yourself.<br><br><i>Astrolabus</i> is a first-person psychological horror game inspired by a true story. It draws on the survival horror of the late 1990s — limited resources, deliberate pacing, and puzzles that expect you to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grounded mystery that unfolds across a remote cabin, an underground grow operation, a forgotten temple buried deeper than either, and the laboratory beneath it all. <br><strong>A story that ends twice.</strong> Once when the credits roll, and once a few days later, when you finally understand what you played.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.poster.avif?t=1776469521\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.webm?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/3247d09e0a8e47a51e19295209208cd0.mp4?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intelligence that is neither friend nor enemy, and may not be quite what it appears to be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world built to be <i>examined</i>. Every room has a history. Most of it is written down somewhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.poster.avif?t=1776469521\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.webm?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/cbbfda035e44a0873bee41dd335b1398.mp4?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with things that should not exist, using whatever you can find.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.poster.avif?t=1776469521\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.webm?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/d7e28805150573a4057e191d32f3b052.mp4?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping narrative that blends science fiction and psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers. No hand-holding. The answers are in the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.poster.avif?t=1776469521\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.webm?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304420/extras/1f349f67fbd71ae430a0f13552d8eceb.mp4?t=1776469521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival horror in the classic tradition.</strong> Manage your light, your ammunition, your nerve. The dark does not negotiate.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astrolabus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alaska. October, 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a cabin. There are footprints in the snow outside that lead away from the door, and a second set that lead nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not remember anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere beneath the wilderness — beneath an illegal grow operation, beneath the older things that were buried before either of those — a laboratory is fail